                   <div class=\"insight-title\"><a href=\"https://simonwillison.net/2026/May/19/gemini-3-5-flash/\" target=\"_blank\">Google Gemini 3.5 Flash Analysis</a></div>\n                    <div class=\"insight-description\">Google released Gemini 3.5 Flash at Google I/O, skipping preview for GA. Discussion of Gemini Spark, prompt injection security, and CLI transition.</div>\n                    <div class=\"insight-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"insight-author\">Simon Willison</span> • 2026-05-19\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"insight-topics\">\n                        <span class=\"tag\">Google</span>\n                        <span class=\"tag\">LLM</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"insight-item\">\n                    <div class=\"insight-title\"><a href=\"https://simonwillison.net/2026/May/19/llms-five-minutes/\" target=\"_blank\">Six Months of LLMs in Five Minutes</a></div>\n                    <div class=\"insight-description\">Lightning talk at PyCon US 2026 covering latest LLM developments from the past six months with annotated presentation tool.</div>\n                    <div class=\"insight-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"insight-author\">Simon Willison</span> • 2026-05-19\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"insight-topics\">\n                        <span class=\"tag\">LLM</span>\n                        <span class=\"tag\">PyCon</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"insight-item\">\n                    <div class=\"insight-title\"><a href=\"https://simonwillison.net/2026/May/17/gds-nhs-open-source/\" target=\"_blank\">UK GDS on NHS Open Source</a></div>\n                    <div class=\"insight-description\">UK Government Digital Service published guidance on NHS open source access: \"Keep open by default\" - closure should be sparing and deliberate