/h2>\n   374→\n   375→                <div class=\"item\">\n   376→                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n   377→                        <a href=\"https://www.producthunt.com/posts/agentrail\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n   378→                            AgentRail\n   379→                        </a>\n   380→                        <span class=\"source-badge\">Product Hunt</span>\n   381→                    </div>\n   382→                    <p class=\"item-description\">\n   383→                        A local control plane for AI coding agents. Focuses on routing, supervising, and auditing multi-agent work across repos, CI, and self-hosted environments.\n   384→                    </p>\n   385→                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n   386→                        <span class=\"tag\">AI coding CLI</span>\n   387→                        <span class=\"release-date\">2026-05-22</span>\n   388→                    </div>\n   389→                </div>\n   390→\n   391→                <div class=\"item\">\n   392→                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n   393→                        <a href=\"https://www.producthunt.com/products/polygram-4\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n   394→                            Polygram\n   395→                        </a>\n   396→                        <span class=\"source-badge\">Product Hunt</span>\n   397→                    </div>\n   398→                    <p class=\"item-description\">\n   399→                        AI-native design and coding app to build mobile & web apps. Unlike tools that 'blindly vibe-code from a prompt,' Polygram first understands your intent before generating code/design.\n   400→                    </p>\n   401→                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n   402→                        <span class=\"tag\">AI IDE</span>\n   403→                        <span class=\"release-date\">2026-05-19</span>\n   404→                    </div>\n   405→                </div>\n   406→\n   407→                <div class=\"item\">\n   408→                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n   409→                        <a href=\"https://github.com/alicomert/pixcode\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n   410→                            Pixcode\n   411→                        </a>\n   412→                        <span class=\"source-badge\">Product Hunt</span>\n   413→                    </div>\n   414→                    <p class=\"item-description\">\n   415→                        A self-hosted control room for AI coding agents. Web UI and desktop/server control room for Claude Code, Cursor CLI, OpenAI Codex, Gemini CLI, Qwen Code, and OpenCode.\n   416→                    </p>\n   417→                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n   418→                        <span class=\"tag\">AI coding CLI</span>\n   419→                        <span class=\"release-date\">2026-05-12</span>\n   420→                    </div>\n   421→                    <div class=\"quote\">\n   422→                        \"its seems like PERFECT!!!\" — Halil (Product Hunt comment)\n   423→                    </div>\n   424→                </div>\n   425→            </section>\n   426→\n   427→            <!-- Whitelist Updates Section -->\n   428→            <section class=\"whitelist-updates\" id=\"updates\">\n   429→                <h2 class=\"section-title\">Whitelist Updates <span class=\"counter\">8</span></h2>\n   430→\n   431→                <div class=\"update-item\">\n   432→                    <div class=\"update-header\">\n   433→                        <div class=\"update-title\">\n   434→                            Claude Code <span class=\"update-version\">v2.1.146</span>\n   435→                        </div>\n   436→                    </div>\n   437→                    <p class=\"update-description\">\n   438→                        Renamed /simplify to /code-review with optional effort level, auto mode no longer suppresses AskUserQuestion, fixed Windows PowerShell tool issues, improved auto-updater reliability with network failure retries.\n   439→                    </p>\n   440→                    <div class=\"update-meta\">\n   441→                        <span class=\"release-date\">2026-05-21</span> |\n   442→                        <a href=\"https://github.com/anthropics/claude-code/releases\" class=\"update-link\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Release Notes</a>\n   443→                    </div>\n   444→                </div>\n   445→\n   446→                <div class=\"update-item\">\n   447→                    <div class=\"update-header\">\n   448→                        <div class=\"update-title\">\n   449→                            Claude Code <span class=\"update-version\">v2.1.145</span>\n   450→                        </div>\n   451→                    </div>\n   452→                    <p class=\"update-description\">\n   453→                        Added claude agents --json for scripting, agent_id tracking in OTEL spans, plugin discover screens show commands/agents/skills before installation, and fixed various issues with MCP prompts.\n   454→                    </p>\n   455→                    <div class=\"update-meta\">\n   456→                        <span class=\"release-date\">2026-05-19</span> |\n   457→                        <a href=\"https://github.com/anthropics/claude-code/releases\" class=\"update-link\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Release Notes</a>\n   458→                    </div>\n   459→                </div>\n   460→\n   461→                <div class=\"update-item\">\n   462→                    <div class=\"update-header\">\n   463→                        <div class=\"update-title\">\n   464→                            Claude Code <span class=\"update-version\">v2.1.144</span>\n   465→                        </div>\n   466→                    </div>\n   467→                    <p class=\"update-description\">\n   468→                        Added /resume support f