              </div>\n   383→                </div>\n   384→            </section>\n   385→\n   386→            <section class=\"whitelist-updates\">\n   387→                <h2>Product Updates (18)</h2>\n   388→\n   389→                <div class=\"update-item\">\n   390→                    <div class=\"product-name\">GitHub Copilot</div>\n   391→                    <div class=\"update-title\">GitHub Copilot for Eclipse is Open Source</div>\n   392→                    <div class=\"update-description\">GitHub Copilot for Eclipse is now open source, allowing community contributions and transparency.</div>\n   393→                    <div class=\"update-date\">2026-05-21</div>\n   394→                </div>\n   395→\n   396→                <div class=\"update-item\">\n   397→                    <div class=\"product-name\">Cursor</div>\n   398→                    <div class=\"update-title\">Improvements to Cursor Automations</div>\n   399→                    <div class=\"update-description\">Cursor Automations brought to Agents Window with multi-repo support, five new templates including Slack digest and product analytics agents, plus Composer 2.5 intelligence improvements.</div>\n   400→                    <div class=\"update-date\">2026-05-21</div>\n   401→                </div>\n   402→\n   403→                <div class=\"update-item\">\n   404→                    <div class=\"product-name\">Claude Code</div>\n   405→                    <div class=\"update-title\">Version 2.1.146</div>\n   406→                    <div class=\"update-description\">Renamed /simplify to /code-review with optional effort level, auto mode no longer suppresses AskUserQuestion, fixed Windows PowerShell issues, improved auto-updater reliability, and enhanced diff rendering performance.</div>\n   407→                    <div class=\"update-date\">2026-05-21</div>\n   408→                </div>\n   409→\n   410→                <div class=\"update-item\">\n   411→                    <div class=\"product-name\">GitHub Copilot</div>\n   412→                    <div class=\"update-title\">Semantic Issue Search in Copilot Chat</div>\n   413→                    <div class=\"update-description\">Copilot Chat now supports semantic issue search, enabling more intelligent and context-aware issue searching capabilities.</div>\n   414→                    <div class=\"update-date\">2026-05-20</div>\n   415→                </div>\n   416→\n   417→                <div class=\"update-item\">\n   418→                    <div class=\"product-name\">GitHub Copilot</div>\n   419→                    <div class=\"update-title\">Gemini 3.5 Flash Generally Available</div>\n   420→                    <div class=\"update-description\">Gemini 3.5 Flash is now generally available for GitHub Copilot, bringing Google's latest AI model to Copilot users.</div>\n   421→                    <div class=\"update-date\">2026-05-19</div>\n   422→                </div>\n   423→\n   424→                <div class=\"update-item\">\n   425→                    <div class=\"product-name\">Claude Code</div>\n   426→                    <div class=\"update-title\">Version 2.1.145</div>\n   427→                    <div class=\"update-description\">Added claude agents --json for scripting, agent_id tracking in OTEL spans, plugin discover screens show commands/agents/skills before installation. Fixed MCP prompts, spinner freezes, and cross-project resume hints.</div>\n   428→                    <div class=\"update-date\">2026-05-19</div>\n   429→                </div>\n   430→\n   431→                <div class=\"update-item\">\n   432→                    <div class=\"product-name\">Claude Code</div>\n   433→                    <div class=\"update-title\">Version 2.1.144</div>\n   434→                    <div class=\"update-description\">Added /resume support for background sessions, elapsed duration to subagent completion notifications, and plugin browse panes now show last update time. Fixed startup hanging and improved terminal rendering.</div>\n   435→                    <div class=\"update-date\">2026-05-19</div>\n   436→                </div>\n   437→\n   438→                <div class=\"update-item\">\n   439→                    <div class=\"product-name\">GitHub Copilot</div>\n   440→                    <div class=\"update-title\">Copilot Cloud Agent: Fast, Cost-Efficient Models</div>\n   441→                    <div class=\"update-description\">Introduced Copilot cloud agent with fast, cost-efficient models optimized for simple tasks, helping reduce costs for routine operations.</div>\n   442→                    <div class=\"update-date\">2026-05-18</div>\n   443→                </div>\n   444→\n   445→                <div class=\"update-item\">\n   446→                    <div class=\"product-name\">GitHub Copilot</div>\n   447→                    <div class=\"update-title\">Ask Questions in Context with Copilot on Web</div>\n   448→                    <div class=\"update-description\">Enhanced Copilot on web to support contextual question asking, improving the web-based AI assistance experience.</div>\n   449→                    <div class=\"update-date\">2026-05-18</div>\n   450→                </div>\n   451→\n   452→                <div class=\"update-item\">\n   453→                    <div class=\"product-name\">GitHub Copilot</div>\n   454→                    <div class=\"update-title\">Copilot Spaces API Now Generally Available</div>\n   455→                    <div class=\"update-description\">The Copilot Spaces API is now generally available, enabling developers to programmatically manage and interact with Copilot Spaces.</div>\n   456→                    <div class=\"update-date\">2026-05-18</div>\n   457→                </div>\n   458→\n   459→                <div class=\"update-item\">\n   460→                    <div class=\"product-name\">Windsurf</div>\n   461→                    <div class=\"update-title\">Version 2.3.9 - Bug Fixes and Improvements</div>\n   462→                    <div class=\"update-description\">Fixed swe-check model availability, improved terminal processing performance, restored conversation sharing, and repaired path resolution for Devin local agent on WSL.</div>\n   463→                    <div class=\"update-date\">2026-05-17</div>\n   464→                </div>\n   465→\n   466→                <div class=\"update-item\">\n   467→                    <div class=\"product-name\">GitHub Copilot</div>\n   468→                    <div class=\"update-title\">GPT-5.3-Codex Now Base Model for Business and Enterprise</div>\n   469→                    <div class=\"update-description\">GPT-5.3-Codex is now the base model for Copilot Business and Enterprise tiers, providing upgraded AI capabilities to business users.</div>\n   470→                    <div class=\"update-date\">2026-05-17</div>\n   471→                </div>\n   472→\n   473→                <div class=\"update-item\">\n   474→                    <div class=\"product-name\">Aider</div>\n   475→                    <div class=\"update-title\">Version 0.86.0 - GPT-5 and Grok-4 Support</div>\n   476→                    <div class=\"update-description\">Added support for all GPT-5 models and Grok-4. Enhanced /clear and /undo commands, added support for gemini-2.5-flash-lite-preview-06-17 and kimi-k2 models.</div>\n   477→                    <div class=\"update-date\">2026-05-17</div>\n   478→                </div>\n   479→\n   480→                <div class=\"update-item\">\n   481→                    <div class=\"product-name\">Claude Code</div>\n   482→                    <div class=\"update-title\">Version 2.1.143</div>\n   483→                    <div class=\"update-description\">Added plugin dependency enforcement, projected context cost to plugin browse pane, and worktree.bgIsolation setting. PowerShell tool now passes -ExecutionPolicy Bypass on Windows.</div>\n   484→                    <div class=\"update-date\">2026-05-15</div>\n   485→                </div>\n   486→\n   487→                <div class=\"update-item\">\n   488→                    <div class=\"product-name\">GitHub Copilot</div>\n   489→                    <div class=\"update-title\">GitHub Copilot App Technical Preview</div>\n   490→                    <div class=\"update-description\">GitHub Copilot app is now available in technical preview, offering a new way to interact with Copilot capabilities.</div>\n   491→                    <div class=\"update-date\">2026-05-14</div>\n   492→                </div>\n   493→\n   494→                <div class=\"update-item\">\n   495→                    <div class=\"product-name\">Claude Code</div>\n   496→                    <div class=\"update-title\">Version 2.1.142</div>\n   497→                    <div class=\"update-description\">Added new claude agents flags for configuring dispatched sessions. Fast mode now uses Opus 4.7 by default. Fixed MCP_TOOL_TIMEOUT and background session issues.</div>\n   498→                    <div class=\"update-date\">2026-05-14</div>\n   499→                </div>\n   500→\n   501→                <div class=\"update-item\">\n   502→                    <div class=\"product-name\">Claude Code</div>\n   503→                    <div class=\"update-title\">Version 2.1.141</div>\n   504→                    <div class=\"update-description\">Added terminalSequence field to hooks, CLAUDE_CODE_PLUGIN_PREFER_HTTPS, and claude agents --cwd flag. Improved spinner feedback and plugin menu navigation.</div>\n   505→                    <div class=\"update-date\">2026-05-13</div>\n   506→                </div>\n   507→\n   508→                <div class=\"update-item\">\n   509→                    <div class=\"product-name\">Claude Code</div>\n   510→                    <div class=\"update-title\">Version 2.1.140</div>\n   511→                    <div class=\"update-description\">Improved Agent tool subagent_type matching, updated agent color palette, and fixed issues with /goal hanging silently and settings hot-reload with symlinked files.</div>\n   512→                    <div class=\"update-date\">2026-05-12</div>\n   513→                </div>\n   514→\n   515→                <div class=\"update-item\">\n   516→                    <div class=\"product-name\">Claude Code</div>\n   517→                    <div class=\"update-title\">Version 2.1.139</div>\n   518→                    <div class=\"update-description\">Added agent view (Research Preview), /goal command for completion conditions, /scroll-speed command, and claude plugin details. Fixed deadlock with expired credentials.</div>\n   519→                    <div class=\"update-date\">2026-05-11</div>\n   520→                </div>\n   521→\n   522→                <div class=\"update-item\">\n   523→                    <div class=\"product-name\">Windsurf</div>\n   524→                    <div class=\"update-title\">Claude Opus 4.7 (fast mode) Now Available</div>\n   525→                    <div class=\"update-description\">Claude Opus 4.7 (fast mode) is now available in Windsurf, offering full intelligence with approximately 2.5x higher output speeds.</div>\n   526→                    <div class=\"update-date\">2026-05-12</div>\n   527→                </div>\n   528→            </section>\n   529→\n   530→            <section class=\"technical-insights\">\n   531→                <h2>Technical Insights (12)</h2>\n   532→\n   533→                <div class=\"insight-item\">\n   534→                    <div class=\"insight-title\"><a href=\"https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=40894321\" target=\"_blank\">Runtime - Sandboxed Coding Agents</a></div>\n   535→                    <div class=\"insight-description\">Launch HN: Runtime (YC P26) - Sandboxed coding agents for everyone on a team. Discussion focuses on team-based AI coding assistants.</div>\n   536→                    <div class=\"insight-meta\">\n   537→                        <span class=\"insight-author\">Hacker News</span> • 2026-05-22\n   538→                    </div>\n   539→                    <div class=\"insight-topics\">\n   540→                        <span class=\"tag\">coding agents</span>\n   541→                        <span class=\"tag\">YC</span>\n   542→                    </div>\n   543→                </div>\n   544→\n   545→                <div class=\"insight-item\">\n   546→                    <div class=\"insight-title\"><a href=\"https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=40894187\" target=\"_blank\">Google's Antigravity Bait and Switch</a></div>\n   547→                    <div class=\"insight-description\">Discussion with 654 points about Google's transition from open source Gemini CLI to closed source Antigravity CLI.</div>\n   548→                    <div class=\"insight-meta\">\n   549→                        <span class=\"insight-author\">Hacker News</span> • 2026-05-22\n   550→                    </div>\n   551→                    <div class=\"insight-topics\">\n   552→                        <span class=\"tag\">Google</span>\n   553→                        <span class=\"tag\">open source</span>\n   554→                    </div>\n   555→                </div>\n   556→\n   557→                <div class=\"insight-item\">\n   558→                    <div class=\"insight-title\"><a href=\"https://simonwillison.net/2026/May/22/ftc-cox-media/\" target=\"_blank\">FTC Settles with Cox Media Group</a></div>\n   559→                    <div class=\"insight-description\">FTC requires Cox Media Group to pay nearly $1M to settle charges about deceptive 'Active Listening' AI marketing claims. Service didn't actually listen to conversations.</div>\n   560→                    <div class=\"insight-meta\">\n   561→                        <span class=\"insight-author\">Simon Willison</span> • 2026-05-22\n   562→                    </div>\n   563→                    <div class=\"insight-topics\">\n   564→                        <span class=\"tag\">privacy</span>\n   565→                        <span class=\"tag\">AI ethics</span>\n   566→                    </div>\n   567→                </div>\n   568→\n   569→                <div class=\"insight-item\">\n   570→                    <div class=\"insight-title\"><a href=\"https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=40893897\" target=\"_blank\">Multi-Stream LLMs Research</a></div>\n   571→                    <div class=\"insight-description\">New arXiv paper on Multi-Stream LLMs exploring parallelizing prompts, thinking, and I/O operations for improved performance.</div>\n   572→                    <div class=\"insight-meta\">\n   573→                        <span class=\"insight-author\">Hacker News</span> • 2026-05-22\n   574→                    </div>\n   575→                    <div class=\"insight-topics\">\n   576→                        <span class=\"tag\">LLM</span>\n   577→                        <span class=\"tag\">research</span>\n   578→                    </div>\n   579→                </div>\n   580→\n   581→                <div class=\"insight-item\">\n   582→                    <div class=\"insight-title\"><a href=\"https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=40894125\" target=\"_blank\">KVBoost - KV Cache Reuse</a></div>\n   583→                    <div class=\"insight-description\">Release of KVBoost for HuggingFace models, achieving 5-48x faster Time To First Token (TTFT) through chunk-level KV cache reuse.</div>\n   584→                    <div class=\"insight-meta\">\n   585→                        <span class=\"insight-author\">Hacker News</span> • 2026-05-22\n   586→                    </div>\n   587→                    <div class=\"insight-topics\">\n   588→                        <span class=\"tag\">LLM</span>\n   589→                        <span class=\"tag\">optimization</span>\n   590→                    </div>\n   591→                </div>\n   592→\n   593→                <div class=\"insight-item\">\n   594→                    <div class=\"insight-title\"><a href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/2605.08871\" target=\"_blank\">CODA: Transformer Block Optimization</a></div>\n   595→                    <div class=\"insight-description\">arXiv paper about rewriting transformer blocks as GEMM-epilogue programs for systems-level optimization.</div>\n   596→                    <div class=\"insight-meta\">\n   597→                        <span class=\"insight-author\">Hacker News</span> • 2026-05-22\n   598→                    </div>\n   599→                    <div class=\"insight-topics\">\n   600→                        <span class=\"tag\">transformers</span>\n   601→                        <span class=\"tag\">optimization</span>\n   602→                    </div>\n   603→                </div>\n   604→\n   605→                <div class=\"insight-item\">\n   606→                    <div class=\"insight-title\"><a href=\"https://simonwillison.net/2026/May/21/datasette-agent/\" target=\"_blank\">Datasette Agent Release</a></div>\n   607→                    <div class=\"insight-description\">First release of Datasette Agent, an extensible AI assistant integrating 3 years of LLM Python library development with Datasette.</div>\n   608→                    <div class=\"insight-meta\">\n   609→                        <span class=\"insight-author\">Simon Willison</span> • 2026-05-21\n   610→                    </div>\n   611→                    <div class=\"insight-topics\">\n   612→                        <span class=\"tag\">AI</span>\n   613→                        <span class=\"tag\">Python</span>\n   614→                    </div>\n   615→                </div>\n   616→\n   617→                <div class=\"insight-item\">\n   618→                    <div class=\"insight-title\"><a href=\"https://simonwillison.net/2026/May/20/anthropic-spacex/\" target=\"_blank\">Anthropic-SpaceX Compute Deal</a></div>\n   619→                    <div class=\"insight-description\">SpaceX S-1 filing reveals $1.25B/month compute deal between Anthropic and SpaceX through May 2029 for COLOSSUS access.</div>\n   620→                    <div class=\"insight-meta\">\n   621→                        <span class=\"insight-author\">Simon Willison</span> • 2026-05-20\n   622→                    </div>\n   623→                    <div class=\"insight-topics\">\n   624→                        <span class=\"tag\">AI</span>\n   625→                        <span class=\"tag\">infrastructure</span>\n   626→                    </div>\n   627→                </div>\n   628→\n   629→                <div class=\"insight-item\">\n   630→                    <div class=\"insight-title\"><a href=\"https://simonwillison.net/2026/May/19/gemini-3-5-flash/\" target=\"_blank\">Google Gemini 3.5 Flash Analysis</a></div>\n   631→                    <div class=\"insight-description\">Google released Gemini 3.5 Flash at Google I/O, skipping preview for GA. Discussion of Gemini Spark, prompt injection security, and CLI transition.</div>\n   632→                    <div class=\"insight-meta\">\n   633→                        <span class=\"insight-author\">Simon Willison</span> • 2026-05-19\n   634→                    </div>\n   635→                    <div class=\"insight-topics\">\n   636→                        <span class=\"tag\">Google</span>\n   637→                        <span class=\"tag\">LLM</span>\n   638→                    </div>\n   639→                </div>\n   640→\n   641→                <div class=\"insight-item\">\n   642→                    <div class=\"insight-title\"><a href=\"https://simonwillison.net/2026/May/19/llms-five-minutes/\" target=\"_blank\">Six Months of LLMs in Five Minutes</a></div>\n   643→                    <div class=\"insight-description\">Lightning talk at PyCon US 2026 covering latest LLM developments from the past six months with annotated presentation tool.</div>\n   644→                    <div class=\"insight-meta\">\n   645→                        <span class=\"insight-author\">Simon Willison</span> • 2026-05-19\n   646→                    </div>\n   647→                    <div class=\"insight-topics\">\n   648→                        <span class=\"tag\">LLM</span>\n   649→                        <span class=\"tag\">PyCon</span>\n   650→                    </div>\n   651→                </div>\n   652→\n   653→                <div class=\"insight-item\">\n   654→                    <div class=\"insight-title\"><a href=\"https://simonwillison.net/2026/May/17/gds-nhs-open-source/\" target=\"_blank\">UK GDS on NHS Open Source</a></div>\n   655→                    <div class=\"insight-description\">UK Government Digital Service published guidance on NHS open source access: \"Keep open by default\" - closure should be sparing and deliberate.</div>\n   656→                    <div class=\"insight-meta\">\n   657→                        <span class=\"insight-author\">Simon Willison</span> • 2026-05-17\n   658→                    </div>\n   659→                    <div class=\"insight-topics\">\n   660→                        <span class=\"tag\">open source</span>\n   661→                        <span class=\"tag\">policy</span>\n   662→                    </div>\n   663→                </div>\n   664→\n   665→                <div class=\"insight-item\">\n   666→                    <div class=\"insight-title\"><a href=\"https://simonwillison.net/2026/May/16/openclaw-names/\" target=\"_blank\">OpenClaw's Six Name Changes</a></div>\n   667→                    <div class=\"insight-description\">Analysis of OpenClaw's naming history: Warelay → CLAWDIS → CLAWDBOT → Clawdbot → Moltbot → OpenClaw (Nov 2025 - Jan 2026).</div>\n   668→                    <div class=\"insight-meta\">\n   669→                        <span class=\"insight-author\">Simon Willison</span> • 2026-05-16\n   670→                    </div>\n   671→                    <div class=\"insight-topics\">\n   672→                        <span class=\"tag\">OpenClaw</span>\n   673→                        <span class=\"tag\">tools</span>\n   674→                    </div>\n   675→                </div>\n   676→\n   677→                <div class=\"insight-item\">\n   678→                    <div class=\"insight-title\"><a href=\"https://simonwillison.net/2026/May/15/datasette-llm-limits/\" target=\"_blank\">Datasette LLM Limits Plugin</a></div>\n   679→                    <div class=\"insight-description\">New Datasette plugin for per-user/global spending limits for LLM usage. Configuration example shows $1.00 per user daily limit with rolling 24-hour window.</div>\n   680→                    <div class=\"insight-meta\">\n   681→                        <span class=\"insight-author\">Simon Willison</span> • 2026-05-15\n   682→                    </div>\n   683→                    <div class=\"insight-topics\">\n   684→                        <span class=\"tag\">Datasette</span>\n   685→                        <span class=\"tag\">LLM</span>\n   686→                    </div>\n   687→                </div>\n   688→            </section>\n   689→        </main>\n   690→\n   691→        <footer>\n   692→            <a href=\"https://github.com/anthropics/claude-code\" target=\"_blank\">Claude Code</a>\n   693→            <a href=\"https://github.com\" target=\"_blank\">GitHub</a>\n   694→            <a href=\"https://news.ycombinator.com\" target=\"_blank\">Hacker News</a>\n   695→            <a href=\"https://producthunt.com\" target=\"_blank\">Product Hunt</a>\n   696→            <div class=\"footer-text\">Report generated by Agent Code Daily - Powered by Claude Agent SDK</div>\n   697→        </footer>\n   698→    </div>\n   699→</body>\n   700→</html>"
